  "prompt": "A quadratic function\n[Figure 1]\nis defined by\n[Figure 2]\n, where\n[Figure 3]\nis a constant. The graph of\n[Figure 4]\nin the\n[Figure 5]\n-plane has an\n[Figure 6]\n-intercept at\n[Figure 7]\n. What is the value of\n[Figure 8]\n?",
  "choices": {
    "A": "[Figure 9]",
    "B": "[Figure 10]",
    "C": "[Figure 11]",
    "D": "[Figure 12]"
